      "updated": 1782220327925,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nENUMS\n\nAlertType.cs\nCategorizes alert warnings (Info, Warning, Critical, WeightDrop,\nPesticideWarning, PesticideWarningCancelled).\n\nAnnouncementAction.cs\n Tracks state updates for scheduled crop treatments (Created,\nRescheduled, Cancelled).\n\nCropType.cs\n Categorizes agricultural plant families (Sunflower, Rapeseed, Lavender,\nAcacia, Linden, Other).\n\nDeviceStatus.cs\n Indicates the pairing status of physical IoT hardware (Unpaired,\nPaired).\n\nErrorType.cs\n Standardizes business-rule failure modes (Failure, Validation,\nNotFound, Conflict, Unauthorized, Unexpected).\n\nHiveType.cs\n Identifies structure styles of beehives (LR, DB, Poloska, Farrar,\nOther).\n\nRoleType.cs\n Outlines user authorization access levels (Admin, Farmer, Beekeeper).\n\nUpdateStatus.cs\n Tracks device firmware updates (UpToDate, PendingUpdate, Updating,\nUpdateFailed)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ZYyIW_rpr7yXYAk88le3C",
      "originalText": "\nENUMS\n\nAlertType.cs\nCategorizes alert warnings (Info, Warning, Critical, WeightDrop, PesticideWarning, PesticideWarningCancelled).\n\nAnnouncementAction.cs\n Tracks state updates for scheduled crop treatments (Created, Rescheduled, Cancelled).\n\nCropType.cs\n Categorizes agricultural plant families (Sunflower, Rapeseed, Lavender, Acacia, Linden, Other).\n\nDeviceStatus.cs\n Indicates the pairing status of physical IoT hardware (Unpaired, Paired).\n\nErrorType.cs\n Standardizes business-rule failure modes (Failure, Validation, NotFound, Conflict, Unauthorized, Unexpected).\n\nHiveType.cs\n Identifies structure styles of beehives (LR, DB, Poloska, Farrar, Other).\n\nRoleType.cs\n Outlines user authorization access levels (Admin, Farmer, Beekeeper).\n\nUpdateStatus.cs\n Tracks device firmware updates (UpToDate, PendingUpdate, Updating, UpdateFailed)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ToX-uzNEca3PcZWptH15K",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 3357.9176964711096,
