    },
    {
      "id": "2FuSNpruNvJ77tLkzbYQe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3364.0510277699377,
      "y": 150.96631538231009,
      "width": 755.7333374023438,
      "height": 1300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2WV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1488892082,
      "version": 358,
      "versionNonce": 950930350,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782220327925,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nMAIN MODELS\n\nUser.cs\n Represents system users (Beekeepers, Farmers, Admins), their settings, and\nauthentication states.\n\nApiary.cs\n Represents a beekeeper's apiary location, defined with GIS coordinates\n(spatial geography point).\n\nHive.cs\nRepresents a single beehive belonging to an apiary, linking it to a physical\nSmartScale.\n\nSmartScale.cs\nRepresents IoT weight scale hardware paired with a hive, tracking battery\nlevel, device status, and telemetry updates.\n\nTelemetry.cs\nTime-series record of measurements (weight, temperature, battery) sent by a\nspecific SmartScale.\n\nHiveInspection.cs\n Periodic health record for a hive tracking queen status, behavior, honey\nlevels, and inspection notes.\n\nParcel.cs\n Represents a farmer's agricultural field or land parcel, defined by a\ngeographic center-point.\n\nCrop.cs\n Represents crops cultivated on a specific agricultural Parcel.\n\nSprinklingAnnouncement.cs\n A scheduled agricultural spraying/pesticide event planned by a farmer on a\nparcel.\n\nSprinklingRecord.cs\n Historic log of a completed sprinkling event, capturing executing conditions\n(weather, wind, precipitation).\n\nNotification.cs\n System alerts generated for users (e.g., low battery alerts or weight drop\nanomalies).\n\nActivationToken.cs\n Represents temporary secure tokens used to activate newly created user\naccounts.\n\nPasswordResetToken.cs\n Security tokens generated to verify password reset requests.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ToX-uzNEca3PcZWptH15K",
      "originalText": "\nMAIN MODELS\n\nUser.cs\n Represents system users (Beekeepers, Farmers, Admins), their settings, and authentication states.\n\nApiary.cs\n Represents a beekeeper's apiary location, defined with GIS coordinates (spatial geography point).\n\nHive.cs\nRepresents a single beehive belonging to an apiary, linking it to a physical SmartScale.\n\nSmartScale.cs\nRepresents IoT weight scale hardware paired with a hive, tracking battery level, device status, and telemetry updates.\n\nTelemetry.cs\nTime-series record of measurements (weight, temperature, battery) sent by a specific SmartScale.\n\nHiveInspection.cs\n Periodic health record for a hive tracking queen status, behavior, honey levels, and inspection notes.\n\nParcel.cs\n Represents a farmer's agricultural field or land parcel, defined by a geographic center-point.\n\nCrop.cs\n Represents crops cultivated on a specific agricultural Parcel.\n\nSprinklingAnnouncement.cs\n A scheduled agricultural spraying/pesticide event planned by a farmer on a parcel.\n\nSprinklingRecord.cs\n Historic log of a completed sprinkling event, capturing executing conditions (weather, wind, precipitation).\n\nNotification.cs\n System alerts generated for users (e.g., low battery alerts or weight drop anomalies).\n\nActivationToken.cs\n Represents temporary secure tokens used to activate newly created user accounts.\n\nPasswordResetToken.cs\n Security tokens generated to verify password reset requests.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
