      "text": "\nCOMMON\n\nAggregateRoot.cs\n Base class for entities that manage domain event\nregistration and serve as aggregate entry points.\n\n\nIDomainEvent.cs\n A marker interface identifying domain events.\n\n\nResult.cs\n Standardized wrapper returned by operations to\nencapsulate values on success or detailed error models\non failure.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "qqyP9esg74YGJKNGPKdCk",
      "originalText": "\nCOMMON\n\nAggregateRoot.cs\n Base class for entities that manage domain event registration and serve as aggregate entry points.\n\n\nIDomainEvent.cs\n A marker interface identifying domain events.\n\n\nResult.cs\n Standardized wrapper returned by operations to encapsulate values on success or detailed error models on failure.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
