      "seed": 1521796526,
      "version": 263,
      "versionNonce": 629518382,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782222111438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FARMER LOGIC\n\nSprinklingAnnouncements: Manages\ncrop treatment scheduling and\nnotifies nearby beekeepers.\n\nSprinklingRecords: Tracks actual\nsprinkling executions, mapping\nweather criteria at the time of\nspraying\n\nCrops: Manages crop varieties\ncultivated on agricultural parcels.\n\nGeo: Performs spatial proximity\ncalculations (e.g., finding apiaries\nnear sprayed fields).\n\nParcels: Manages geographic\nagricultural fields owned by\nfarmers.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "8eGTVEDzuPsLp57chqDbK",
      "originalText": "FARMER LOGIC\n\nSprinklingAnnouncements: Manages crop treatment scheduling and notifies nearby beekeepers.\n\nSprinklingRecords: Tracks actual sprinkling executions, mapping weather criteria at the time of spraying\n\nCrops: Manages crop varieties cultivated on agricultural parcels.\n\nGeo: Performs spatial proximity calculations (e.g., finding apiaries near sprayed fields).\n\nParcels: Manages geographic agricultural fields owned by farmers.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PdIs-VZnUkeqsaIBlaKSf",
