      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SMART SCALES\n\nSmartScales: Pauses, activates,\npairs, and manages IoT scale device\nthresholds\n\nTelemetries: Ingests, validates, and\nqueries raw weight, temp, and\nbattery telemetry records.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "LsoVSCkW47VB31e_Cd9yH",
      "originalText": "SMART SCALES\n\nSmartScales: Pauses, activates, pairs, and manages IoT scale device thresholds\n\nTelemetries: Ingests, validates, and queries raw weight, temp, and battery telemetry records.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
