      "updated": 1782222890335,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REGISTER SMART SCALE\n\nTrigger: HTTP POST\n/api/smartscales/register\n(Anonymous)\n\nAction: De-serializes payload\ninto\nRegisterSmartScaleCommand\nand sends it to MediatR.\n\nRole: Registers a new\nphysical IoT scale on the\nplatform.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "CWePvVfQVzJ5ru3QZjX-p",
      "originalText": "REGISTER SMART SCALE\n\nTrigger: HTTP POST /api/smartscales/register (Anonymous)\n\nAction: De-serializes payload into RegisterSmartScaleCommand and sends it to MediatR.\n\nRole: Registers a new physical IoT scale on the platform.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
