      "updated": 1782222890335,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ACTIVATE SMART SCALE\n\nTrigger: HTTP POST\n/api/smartscales/activate\n(Anonymous)\n\nAction: De-serializes payload into\nActivateSmartScaleCommand and\nsends it to MediatR.\n\nRole: Activates the scale and links\nit to a specific beehive.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "w7eSMRrCXfOHKxK2XZ4US",
      "originalText": "ACTIVATE SMART SCALE\n\nTrigger: HTTP POST /api/smartscales/activate (Anonymous)\n\nAction: De-serializes payload into ActivateSmartScaleCommand and sends it to MediatR.\n\nRole: Activates the scale and links it to a specific beehive.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
