      "text": "INGEST TELEMETRY\n\nTrigger: HTTP POST /api/telemetry\n(Anonymous)\nHeaders: Expects X-Device-Token\nkey.\n\nAction: Attaches the device token\nto IngestTelemetryCommand and\nsends it to MediatR.\n\nRole: Receives raw weight,\ntemperature, and battery telemetry\npayloads from scales.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "FAKtILtYYOit2pae7yuMX",
      "originalText": "INGEST TELEMETRY\n\nTrigger: HTTP POST /api/telemetry (Anonymous)\nHeaders: Expects X-Device-Token key.\n\nAction: Attaches the device token to IngestTelemetryCommand and sends it to MediatR.\n\nRole: Receives raw weight, temperature, and battery telemetry payloads from scales.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
