      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PROCESS ALERTS\n\nTrigger: QueueTrigger listening on queue\nAzureQueueOptions:AlertQueue (via connection\nAzureWebJobsStorage).\n\nAction: Maps the queue message to domain\nmodel and dispatches ProcessAlertCommand to\nMediatR.\n\nRole: Handles device anomaly events\nasynchronously (e.g. queueing alarm\nnotifications or emails).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "8NmfKSKcjqHBp0c4VKrNx",
      "originalText": "PROCESS ALERTS\n\nTrigger: QueueTrigger listening on queue AzureQueueOptions:AlertQueue (via connection AzureWebJobsStorage).\n\nAction: Maps the queue message to domain model and dispatches ProcessAlertCommand to MediatR.\n\nRole: Handles device anomaly events asynchronously (e.g. queueing alarm notifications or emails).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
