      "updated": 1782223031542,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SPARKLING ANNOUNCEMENT MONITOR\n\nTrigger: QueueTrigger listening on queue\nAzureQueueOptions:AnnouncementQueue (via\nconnection AzureWebJobsStorage).\n\nAction: Dispatches\nProcessSprinklingAnnouncementCommand with the\ntarget announcement ID and action.\n\nRole: Triggers proximity alerts to notify beekeepers\nwhen farmers schedule crop spraying nearby.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "3kxfEO4uqGrZXnF8644oy",
      "originalText": "SPARKLING ANNOUNCEMENT MONITOR\n\nTrigger: QueueTrigger listening on queue AzureQueueOptions:AnnouncementQueue (via connection AzureWebJobsStorage).\n\nAction: Dispatches ProcessSprinklingAnnouncementCommand with the target announcement ID and action.\n\nRole: Triggers proximity alerts to notify beekeepers when farmers schedule crop spraying nearby.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
