      "updated": 1782223452624,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CONTROLLERS\n\nAuthController: Handles login, JWT generation, password changes,\nand account activation.\n\nApiariesController: Creating, updating, deleting, and fetching\napiaries (with GIS queries).\n\nHivesController: Adding, editing, and managing beehive records.\n\nSmartScalesController: Pairing, unpairing, and adjusting hardware\nwarning thresholds.\n\nTelemetryController: Reading historical telemetry data logs for\ncharts.\n\nHiveInspectionsController: CRUD operations on beehive health\nrecords.\n\nSprinklingAnnouncementsController: Scheduling agricultural chemical\nspraying events.\n\nSprinklingRecordsController: Generating, fetching, and exporting\nsprinkling reports as PDFs.\n\nCropsController & ParcelsController: Managing farm lands and crop\nregisters.\n\nUsersController & NotificationsController: Fetching user settings\nand viewing notifications.\n\nGeoController: Resolving coordinate mappings.\n\nDebugController: A helper endpoint for seeding local developer\ntables and blobs.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "gvg8phEZtrAqyhpRSot2u",
      "originalText": "CONTROLLERS\n\nAuthController: Handles login, JWT generation, password changes, and account activation.\n\nApiariesController: Creating, updating, deleting, and fetching apiaries (with GIS queries).\n\nHivesController: Adding, editing, and managing beehive records.\n\nSmartScalesController: Pairing, unpairing, and adjusting hardware warning thresholds.\n\nTelemetryController: Reading historical telemetry data logs for charts.\n\nHiveInspectionsController: CRUD operations on beehive health records.\n\nSprinklingAnnouncementsController: Scheduling agricultural chemical spraying events.\n\nSprinklingRecordsController: Generating, fetching, and exporting sprinkling reports as PDFs.\n\nCropsController & ParcelsController: Managing farm lands and crop registers.\n\nUsersController & NotificationsController: Fetching user settings and viewing notifications.\n\nGeoController: Resolving coordinate mappings.\n\nDebugController: A helper endpoint for seeding local developer tables and blobs.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
