      "text": "SIGNAL IR REAL TIME SOCKET\nDEVICE HUB\n\n- Sub-Groups: apiary:{Id}, hive:{Id},\nbeekeeper:{Id}, and private:\n{UserId}.\n\n- Role: Allows frontend dashboards\nto subscribe to specific hives or\napiaries to receive real-time streams\nof telemetry and alerts.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "eH5hJVG1jLY2pMwG97K1f",
      "originalText": "SIGNAL IR REAL TIME SOCKET\nDEVICE HUB\n\n- Sub-Groups: apiary:{Id}, hive:{Id}, beekeeper:{Id}, and private:{UserId}.\n\n- Role: Allows frontend dashboards to subscribe to specific hives or apiaries to receive real-time streams of telemetry and alerts.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
