      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "BACKGROUND WORKERS\n\nTelemetryBroadcastWorker\nTrigger: Infinite loop polling ITelemetryQueueService (runs every 2 seconds if no message).\nAction: Dequeues a raw telemetry packet, broadcasts it immediately to hive, apiary, and\nbeekeeper SignalR groups, and dispatches a ProcessTelemetryCommand to MediatR.\n\nSprinklingAnnouncementWorker\nTrigger: Timer polling every 30 seconds.\nAction: Dispatches ProcessExpiredAnnouncementsCommand to MediatR to archive/cleanup\nexpired crop treatments.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "5T14a4DGs6psUOG3RzLth",
      "originalText": "BACKGROUND WORKERS\n\nTelemetryBroadcastWorker\nTrigger: Infinite loop polling ITelemetryQueueService (runs every 2 seconds if no message).\nAction: Dequeues a raw telemetry packet, broadcasts it immediately to hive, apiary, and beekeeper SignalR groups, and dispatches a ProcessTelemetryCommand to MediatR.\n\nSprinklingAnnouncementWorker\nTrigger: Timer polling every 30 seconds.\nAction: Dispatches ProcessExpiredAnnouncementsCommand to MediatR to archive/cleanup expired crop treatments.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qihifpYVukVfoUcLeMNUR",
