      "updated": 1782223467723,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "BROADCAST HANDLERS\n\nAlertSignalRBroadcastEventHandler\nListens to: AnomalyDetectedDomainEvent,\nBatteryLowDomainEvent,\nPesticideWarningDomainEvent,\nPesticideWarningCancelledDomainEvent.\nAction: Maps the alert payload and\nbroadcasts it to the affected Beekeeper's\nSignalR group (ReceiveAlert).\n\nNotificationSignalRBroadcastEventHandler\nListens to: NotificationCreatedDomainEvent.\nAction: Broadcasts the new notification\ndirectly to the user's private SignalR channel\n(ReceiveNotification).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "qihifpYVukVfoUcLeMNUR",
      "originalText": "BROADCAST HANDLERS\n\nAlertSignalRBroadcastEventHandler\nListens to: AnomalyDetectedDomainEvent, BatteryLowDomainEvent, PesticideWarningDomainEvent, PesticideWarningCancelledDomainEvent.\nAction: Maps the alert payload and broadcasts it to the affected Beekeeper's SignalR group (ReceiveAlert).\n\nNotificationSignalRBroadcastEventHandler\nListens to: NotificationCreatedDomainEvent.\nAction: Broadcasts the new notification directly to the user's private SignalR channel (ReceiveNotification).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
